      "views": [
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Make copies of your apps using the **jailbreak** \u2014 no TrollStore needed. Each copy is a normal app with its own name, its own data, and its own spot on the Home Screen.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "How it works"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "1. Open **TD Lite** and tap the app you want to copy.\n2. Give the copy a name.\n3. TD Lite gives it a new bundle ID, re-signs it with ldid, and installs it with AppSync Unified.\n4. The copy shows up on your Home Screen. Delete it there, or from TD Lite.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Good to know"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Needs **AppSync Unified** and **ldid** (Sileo installs both for you).\n- App Store apps must be **decrypted** first, or the copy won't open.\n- Widgets, extensions and Watch apps aren't copied.\n- Copies only run while the device is jailbroken.\n- Works on rootful (Odyssey, Taurine, Chimera) and rootless (Dopamine) jailbreaks.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
